column48:
Multiple college campus elevators have year+ expired certifications, elevator for "Rainier Hall (RAH)" building has visible duct tape holding parts of it together (and has for more than a year); 

ramp outside the "CCC" building has been rotting away (Child Care Center, program operated by South Seattle College Cooperative Preschools/West Seattle Preschools); 

power assist and external door openers for "Student Wellness Center (SWC)" have been nonfunctional for 3+ years despite documented comp
